&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Technical Writer who brings craft and strategic instinct to the discipline. We want someone who can own complex documentation initiatives end to end, influence how content is structured and delivered at scale, operate with authority in a fast-moving, highly technical environment, and help their team succeed with AI-assisted tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Technical Writer at Starburst, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
